🛠 JavaScript Features Summary
# Implemented Features
- Navigation: Mobile menu, smooth scrolling, back-to-top
- Homepage: Hero slider with auto-play and controls
- Menu Page: Search, filtering, image lightbox
- Media: Video player with custom controls
- Forms: Validation, submission handling, persistence
- UI/UX: Scroll animations, lazy loading, debounced search

